  message: "Measured 2026-11-16 on dev a35aeb56aa (stableid v15), 45 trees with --include-docs (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr2/fleet_idformat.txt): 26 nodes with an `<unknown>` path slot remain, by producer: latex 19 on sqlalchemy's docs (`amsmath:<unknown>:0-0:amsmath:external_symbol`: the package name sits in the lang slot), robot 4 on harbor tests (`robot:<unknown>:0-0:resource:external_symbol`, and one with an empty name slot), meson `subdir` 2 (meson, git-gui), fortran `external` 1 (meson). Seen on a fixture: twig `include('x.twig')` -> `twig:<unknown>:0-0:template:external_symbol`. latex.py, robot.py, meson.py and fortran.py are in this item's list; twig is not."  # c69b
